@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
title UC05 创建订单 序列图
actor 操作员 as U
boundary "订单表单/HTTP API" as B
control "OrderService" as C
database "H2" as DB
U -> B : 校验Movement请求
B -> C : 调用用例操作
C -> DB : 创建PENDING订单、发布ORDER_CREATED，不扣库存
DB --> C : 结果
C --> B : 返回订单ID
B --> U : 显示结果或错误
@enduml
